---
import { pijak2027 } from '../data/programs';
---

<section id="benefit" class="bg-slate-50/70 py-20 px-4 relative overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-200/80">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10 fade-in-up px-2 sm:px-4">
        
        <div class="text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <div class="badge-pill-blue mb-3">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse"></span>
                Keunggulan Program
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-dark-slate tracking-tight mb-3">
                Benefit Program Beasiswa Coding
            </h2>
            <p class="text-subtle text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
                Seluruh program beasiswa yang dihadirkan di portal Beasiswa Coding dirancang bersama mitra industri teknologi global untuk memberikan akselerasi karier nyata bagi talenta Indonesia.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Core Benefit Cards Grid with Staggered Entrance & Interactive Hover -->
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 stagger-container reveal-on-scroll">
            
            <!-- Benefit 1 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-400 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-100 transition-all duration-300">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-slate mb-2">Pelatihan 100% Gratis Online</h3>
                    <p class="text-subtle text-sm leading-relaxed font-normal">
                        Seluruh kurikulum IBM SkillsBuild dan Dicoding berstandar industri global dapat diakses secara gratis tanpa biaya registrasi maupun biaya tersembunyi.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-bold text-primary flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    Standar Global IBM
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Benefit 2 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-400 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-100 transition-all duration-300">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-slate mb-2">Sertifikat Kompetensi Resmi</h3>
                    <p class="text-subtle text-sm leading-relaxed font-normal">
                        Dapatkan sertifikat kompetensi yang diakui industri setelah menyelesaikan kurikulum dan lulus program Beasiswa Intensif untuk memperkuat CV portofolio Anda.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-bold text-primary flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    Verifikasi Resmi Dicoding
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Benefit 3 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-400 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-100 transition-all duration-300">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-slate mb-2">Akses Materi Seumur Hidup</h3>
                    <p class="text-subtle text-sm leading-relaxed font-normal">
                        Akses materi pembelajaran di IBM SkillsBuild dan Dicoding tetap terbuka seumur hidup, memungkinkan Anda me-review ilmu kapan saja di masa depan.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-bold text-primary flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    Lifetime Learning
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Benefit 4 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-400 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-100 transition-all duration-300">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-slate mb-2">Bimbingan Expert &amp; Praktisi</h3>
                    <p class="text-subtle text-sm leading-relaxed font-normal">
                        Pendampingan teknis dan non-teknis bersama instruktur ahli dari IBM dan tech company terkemuka lainnya selama tahapan Beasiswa Intensif.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-bold text-primary flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    Mentoring &amp; Capstone
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
</section>
